OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 3, critically ill after
OL,4,Anursery incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-year-old boy is believed to be
OL,7,Ffighting for his life after an incident
OL,8,Fat a nursery in Greater Manchester,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to Cosy
OL,12,FToes Nursery on Mainway East in
OL,13,FMiddleton at 15:49 GMT on Monday
OL,14,FNovember 2.
OL,16,FThe boy was taken to hospital, where he
OL,17,Fremains in a critical condition.
OL,19,FGreater Manchester Police said his
OL,20,Fparents had been informed and were with
OL,21,Fhim.
